# ==============================================================================
# Nokia SR OS (TiMOS) License File Template
# ==============================================================================
# Place your valid Nokia SR OS / SRsim license in this directory as 'license.txt'.
#
# Steps:
# 1. Obtain a valid license file from your Nokia representative or support portal.
# 2. Copy or save it to: license/license.txt
#    Example: cp /path/to/my_license.txt license/license.txt
#
# Expected Format:
# <UUID> <BASE64_SIGNATURE_PAYLOAD> # NOKIA BELL NV(TiMOS-[BC]-25.*)
#
# Note:
# 'license.txt' is intentionally ignored by Git to prevent leaking proprietary
# or confidential license keys to public or shared repositories.
